OL,3,GNEWSACraft club a 'piece of home' for
OL,4,Awomen from Hong Kong
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who have moved to the UK from
OL,7,FHong Kong say they have found a sense
OL,8,Fof community and belonging through a
OL,9,Fcrocheting group.
OL,11,FMore than 60 people living in the West
OL,12,Fof England meet at the Crafting Smiles
OL,13,Fcrocheting group in Bristol once a
OL,14,Ffortnight. The members said it allowed
OL,15,Fthem to make friends and take part in
OL,16,Fcreative projects.
OL,18,FSince it launched in October 2025, the
OL,19,Fgroup has grown its membership by 10
OL,20,Ftimes and crocheted Remembrance poppies
OL,21,Fand baby items for charity.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
